Package: xios-kde
Name: Xios Desktop (KDE Plasma Mobile)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), xios-core, kwin, plasma-mobile, plasma-nano, qt6-wayland, kf6-breeze-icons
MinimumOSVersion: 16.0.0
Description: the KDE Plasma Mobile desktop flavor for Xios
 KDE Plasma Mobile on KWin, rendered on the iPad GPU through the iosc
 compositor and ANGLE. Pulls in the Qt 6 runtime, the KDE Frameworks 6
 subset Plasma needs, KWin, and the Plasma Mobile shell with the Breeze
 look.
 .
 Installing this package is the whole setup: open the Xios app afterwards
 and the Plasma session starts.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.0 or newer. Target profile: @REPO_PROFILE@.
